WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.120
Hey, I'm Juliano. I run a coaching

00:00:02.120 --> 00:00:03.840
business, BrightPath.

00:00:03.840 --> 00:00:06.180
So, before these guys, I was doing

00:00:06.180 --> 00:00:08.540
everything myself, man. The funnels, the

00:00:08.540 --> 00:00:10.400
follow-ups, the marketing.

00:00:10.400 --> 00:00:12.350
I was working in the business all day,

00:00:12.350 --> 00:00:14.480
not on it, you know. And they came in and

00:00:14.480 --> 00:00:16.240
set up everything on Go High level.

00:00:16.240 --> 00:00:18.660
The funnels, the automations, the whole

00:00:18.660 --> 00:00:22.100
marketing system, end to end. And now, it

00:00:22.100 --> 00:00:23.720
just runs.

00:00:23.720 --> 00:00:25.890
Leads come in, they get followed up, they

00:00:25.890 --> 00:00:28.330
get booked, automatically. And honestly,

00:00:28.330 --> 00:00:30.200
the revenue speaks for itself.

00:00:30.200 --> 00:00:32.060
But the biggest thing for me, I don't

00:00:32.060 --> 00:00:34.200
think about the online stuff anymore.

00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:36.470
I just focus on my business, and they

00:00:36.470 --> 00:00:39.160
handle the rest. Best decision I've made,

00:00:39.160 --> 00:00:39.640
period.
